  <bioghist id="3557c7b5cf6bb937c890a276944a6385">
    <head>Biographical / Historical</head>
<p>John W. Sewell served as President of the Overseas Development Council.</p>  </bioghist>
  <scopecontent id="7c0d1fed35a7154b3f3bf7705b342a1b">
    <head>Scope and Contents</head>
<p>The papers primarily document Sewell's activities with the Overseas Development Council and consist of reports, proposals, correspondence, memoranda, conference proceedings and publications in the areas of US-Foreign Aid reform, the World Bank, IMF, and other areas of economic development interest.</p>  </scopecontent>
